    {
      "text": "silos. The problem was never the food.",
      "start": 330.84,
      "duration": 4.92,
      "end": 335.76
    },
    {
      "text": "End of day five, $200 billion spent,",
      "start": 333.16,
      "duration": 5.48,
      "end": 338.64
    },
    {
      "text": "$800 billion left. You try to buy a",
      "start": 335.76,
      "duration": 5.04,
      "end": 340.8
    },
    {
      "text": "country. Argentina is carrying roughly",
      "start": 338.64,
      "duration": 5.04,
      "end": 343.68
    },
    {
      "text": "$400 billion in national debt, IMF",
      "start": 340.8,
      "duration": 4.96,
      "end": 345.76
    },
    {
      "text": "obligations, restructured bonds,",
      "start": 343.68,
      "duration": 4.52,
      "end": 348.2
    },
    {
      "text": "renegotiated so many times the paperwork",
      "start": 345.76,
      "duration": 4.76,
      "end": 350.52
    },
    {
      "text": "fills rooms. You put a cash offer on the",
      "start": 348.2,
      "duration": 4.2,
      "end": 352.4
    },
    {
      "text": "table, full debt clearance in exchange",
      "start": 350.52,
      "duration": 4.16,
      "end": 354.68
    },
    {
      "text": "for special economic zone authority over",
      "start": 352.4,
      "duration": 4.72,
      "end": 357.12
    },
    {
      "text": "the port of Buenos Aires. The government",
      "start": 354.68,
      "duration": 4.56,
      "end": 359.24
    },
    {
      "text": "signals it wants the deal. Of course it",
      "start": 357.12,
      "duration": 5.04,
      "end": 362.16
    },
    {
      "text": "does. The IMF calls within 4 hours. The",
      "start": 359.24,
      "duration": 5.6,
      "end": 364.84
    },
    {
      "text": "US State Department calls within 6. Not",
      "start": 362.16,
      "duration": 4.52,
      "end": 366.68
    },
    {
      "text": "to negotiate, to make clear this isn't",
      "start": 364.84,
      "duration": 3.92,
      "end": 368.76
    },
    {
      "text": "happening. Money can buy a government's",
      "start": 366.68,
      "duration": 3.92,
      "end": 370.6
    },
    {
      "text": "attention. It cannot buy sovereignty",
      "start": 368.76,
      "duration": 3.32,
      "end": 372.08
    },
    {
      "text": "because sovereignty isn't something",
      "start": 370.6,
      "duration": 3.76,
      "end": 374.36
    },
    {
      "text": "governments control alone. Other nations",
      "start": 372.08,
      "duration": 4.28,
      "end": 376.36
    },
    {
      "text": "get a vote. Those nations will not allow",
      "start": 374.36,
      "duration": 3.72,
      "end": 378.08
    },
    {
      "text": "a private individual to hold port",
      "start": 376.36,
      "duration": 3.48,
      "end": 379.84
    },
    {
      "text": "authority over a major South American",
      "start": 378.08,
      "duration": 3.64,
      "end": 381.72
    },
    {
      "text": "trade hub. You try three smaller",
      "start": 379.84,
      "duration": 4.28,
      "end": 384.12
    },
    {
      "text": "nations. The wall is the same each time,",
      "start": 381.72,
      "duration": 3.64,
      "end": 385.36
    },
    {
      "text": "just different [music] accents on the",
      "start": 384.12,
      "duration": 3.44,
      "end": 387.56
    },
    {
      "text": "other end. Every offer gets blocked",
      "start": 385.36,
      "duration": 4.12,
      "end": 389.48
    },
    {
      "text": "before the paperwork reaches anyone with",
      "start": 387.56,
      "duration": 4.16,
      "end": 391.72
    },
    {
      "text": "a pen. The interest kept running during",
      "start": 389.48,
      "duration": 5.88,
      "end": 395.36
    },
    {
      "text": "those calls. Another $136 million",
      "start": 391.72,
      "duration": 6.92,
      "end": 398.64
    },
    {
      "text": "right on schedule. End of day 6, $210",
      "start": 395.36,
      "duration": 6.72,
      "end": 402.08
    },
    {
      "text": "billion spent, $790 billion",
      "start": 398.64,
      "duration": 7.12,
      "end": 405.76
    },
    {
      "text": "remaining. $790 billion left. are",
      "start": 402.08,
      "duration": 5.8,
      "end": 407.88
    },
    {
      "text": "blocked. You stop trying to own things",
      "start": 405.76,
      "duration": 4.28,
      "end": 410.04
    },
    {
      "text": "that require diplomats. Public companies",
      "start": 407.88,
      "duration": 3.8,
      "end": 411.68
    },
    {
      "text": "don't need a government's approval, they",
      "start": 410.04,
      "duration": 3.56,
      "end": 413.6
    },
    {
      "text": "just need a buyer. Your team begins",
      "start": 411.68,
      "duration": 4.16,
      "end": 415.84
    },
    {
      "text": "executing block trades across the S&P",
      "start": 413.6,
      "duration": 5.04,
      "end": 418.64
    },
    {
      "text": "500. Not one company, all of them. The",
      "start": 415.84,
      "duration": 4.68,
      "end": 420.52
    },
    {
      "text": "strategy is mechanical. Start with the",
      "start": 418.64,
      "duration": 4.48,
      "end": 423.12
    },
    {
      "text": "largest by market cap, work down. Apple,",
      "start": 420.52,
      "duration": 4.68,
      "end": 425.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Microsoft, Nvidia. You aren't doing",
      "start": 423.12,
      "duration": 3.76,
      "end": 426.88
    },
    {
      "text": "hostile takeovers through the normal",
      "start": 425.2,
      "duration": 3.6,
      "end": 428.8
    },
    {
      "text": "process. You're buying enough shares in",
      "start": 426.88,
      "duration": 3.64,
      "end": 430.52
    },
    {
      "text": "a single session to force a majority",
      "start": 428.8,
      "duration": 3.68,
      "end": 432.48
    },
    {
      "text": "position before anyone can convene a",
      "start": 430.52,
      "duration": 4.16,
      "end": 434.68
    },
    {
      "text": "board meeting. Securities law requires a",
      "start": 432.48,
      "duration": 4.36,
      "end": 436.84
    },
    {
      "text": "20 business day window for a formal",
      "start": 434.68,
      "duration": 4.2,
      "end": 438.88
    },
    {
      "text": "tender offer. You don't have 20 days,",
      "start": 436.84,
      "duration": 4.12,
      "end": 440.96
    },
    {
      "text": "you have hours. So you don't file, you",
      "start": 438.88,
      "duration": 4.52,
      "end": 443.4
    },
    {
      "text": "just buy. The first $50 billion moves",
      "start": 440.96,
      "duration": 4.6,
      "end": 445.56
    },
    {
      "text": "cleanly. The market absorbs it the way a",
      "start": 443.4,
      "duration": 4.92,
      "end": 448.32
    },
    {
      "text": "river absorbs a stone. A ripple, then",
      "start": 445.56,
      "duration": 4.52,
      "end": 450.08
    },
    {
      "text": "nothing. Then the pattern becomes",
      "start": 448.32,
      "duration": 3.8,
      "end": 452.12
    },
    {
      "text": "visible to the algorithms. Every major",
      "start": 450.08,
      "duration": 3.72,
      "end": 453.8
    },
    {
      "text": "trading desk on Earth is watching the",
      "start": 452.12,
      "duration": 4.04,
      "end": 456.16
    },
    {
      "text": "same tape. Someone is buying everything.",
      "start": 453.8,
      "duration": 5.04,
      "end": 458.84
    },
    {
      "text": "Not rotating, not hedging, buying. All",
      "start": 456.16,
      "duration": 6.12,
      "end": 462.28
    },
    {
      "text": "of it, at any price. The S&P 500 rises",
      "start": 458.84,
      "duration": 8.0,
      "end": 466.84
    },
    {
      "text": "4% in 40 minutes, then 9%, then 14%,",
      "start": 462.28,
      "duration": 6.16,
      "end": 468.44
    },
    {
      "text": "you're not buying stocks, you're",
      "start": 466.84,
      "duration": 3.64,
      "end": 470.48
    },
    {
      "text": "becoming the price. Every share you",
      "start": 468.44,
      "duration": 3.72,
      "end": 472.16
    },
    {
      "text": "purchase costs more than the last",
      "start": 470.48,
      "duration": 3.12,
      "end": 473.6
    },
    {
      "text": "because your own orders are the [music]",
      "start": 472.16,
      "duration": 3.44,
      "end": 475.6
    },
    {
      "text": "news the market is pricing in. The",
      "start": 473.6,
      "duration": 4.76,
      "end": 478.36
    },
    {
      "text": "trillionaire premium. You spend $100",
      "start": 475.6,
      "duration": 3.76,
      "end": 479.36
    },
    {
      "text": "billion",
      "start": 478.36,
      "duration": 2.76,
      "end": 481.12
    },
    {
      "text": "and acquire less than you would have if",
      "start": 479.36,
      "duration": 4.48,
      "end": 483.84
    },
    {
      "text": "you'd spent $40 billion an hour earlier.",
      "start": 481.12,
      "duration": 4.52,
      "end": 485.64
    },
    {
      "text": "The math is running in reverse. [music]",
      "start": 483.84,
      "duration": 4.36,
      "end": 488.2
    },
    {
      "text": "By mid-morning the NYSE circuit breakers",
      "start": 485.64,
      "duration": 5.2,
      "end": 490.84
    },
    {
      "text": "trip. Trading halts for 15 minutes. It",
      "start": 488.2,
      "duration": 4.8,
      "end": 493.0
    },
    {
      "text": "resumes. You keep buying. It halts",
      "start": 490.84,
      "duration": 4.68,
      "end": 495.52
    },
    {
      "text": "again. The SEC issues an emergency",
      "start": 493.0,
      "duration": 4.44,
      "end": 497.44
    },
    {
      "text": "statement. Unusual coordinated",
      "start": 495.52,
      "duration": 3.88,
      "end": 499.4
    },
    {
      "text": "acquisition activity across multiple",
      "start": 497.44,
      "duration": 4.12,
      "end": 501.56
    },
    {
      "text": "sectors. They don't name you. They don't",
      "start": 499.4,
      "duration": 4.28,
      "end": 503.68
    },
    {
      "text": "need to. Your team's lawyers are already",
      "start": 501.56,
      "duration": 3.6,
      "end": 505.16
    },
    {
      "text": "on a call with the commission before the",
      "start": 503.68,
      "duration": 3.64,
      "end": 507.32
    },
    {
      "text": "statement finishes loading. The EU",
      "start": 505.16,
      "duration": 4.76,
      "end": 509.92
    },
    {
      "text": "follows within 90 minutes. Euronext",
      "start": 507.32,
      "duration": 4.4,
      "end": 511.72
    },
    {
      "text": "suspends trading across Paris,",
      "start": 509.92,
      "duration": 3.96,
      "end": 513.88
    },
    {
      "text": "Amsterdam, Brussels, [music] and Lisbon.",
      "start": 511.72,
      "duration": 4.44,
      "end": 516.16
    },
    {
      "text": "The Frankfurt Exchange goes next. The",
      "start": 513.88,
      "duration": 4.08,
      "end": 517.96
    },
    {
      "text": "Tokyo Stock Exchange issues a",
      "start": 516.16,
      "duration": 4.24,
      "end": 520.4
    },
    {
      "text": "precautionary pause citing an anomalous",
      "start": 517.96,
      "duration": 4.56,
      "end": 522.52
    },
    {
      "text": "cross-border capital flows. You have",
      "start": 520.4,
      "duration": 4.28,
      "end": 524.68
    },
    {
      "text": "broken four stock exchanges before noon",
      "start": 522.52,
      "duration": 5.08,
      "end": 527.6
    },
    {
      "text": "on the last day. The SEC doesn't freeze",
      "start": 524.68,
      "duration": 5.32,
      "end": 530.0
    },
    {
      "text": "your account. They freeze the markets.",
      "start": 527.6,
      "duration": 3.84,
      "end": 531.44
    },
    {
      "text": "There's a legal difference and it",
      "start": 530.0,
      "duration": 3.56,
      "end": 533.56
    },
    {
      "text": "matters. They can't stop you from having",
      "start": 531.44,
      "duration": 4.24,
      "end": 535.68
    },
    {
      "text": "money, but they can stop the venues",
      "start": 533.56,
      "duration": 4.36,
      "end": 537.92
    },
    {
      "text": "where that money moves. Every exchange",
      "start": 535.68,
      "duration": 3.76,
      "end": 539.44
    },
    {
      "text": "you haven't reached yet goes on",
      "start": 537.92,
      "duration": 3.48,
      "end": 541.4
    },
    {
      "text": "preemptive halt. The London Stock",
      "start": 539.44,
      "duration": 4.76,
      "end": 544.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Exchange, Hong Kong, Sydney. Regulators",
      "start": 541.4,
      "duration": 5.0,
      "end": 546.4
    },
    {
      "text": "on six continents are on the same call",
      "start": 544.2,
      "duration": 3.52,
      "end": 547.72
    },
    {
      "text": "and the word they keep using is",
      "start": 546.4,
      "duration": 4.72,
      "end": 551.12
    },
    {
      "text": "systemic, not illegal. Systemic. You are",
      "start": 547.72,
      "duration": 5.36,
      "end": 553.08
    },
    {
      "text": "a weather event and they are closing the",
      "start": 551.12,
      "duration": 4.44,
      "end": 555.56
    },
    {
      "text": "airports. By the time trading resumes,",
      "start": 553.08,
      "duration": 4.44,
      "end": 557.52
    },
    {
      "text": "partially with per account acquisition",
      "start": 555.56,
      "duration": 4.16,
      "end": 559.72
    },
    {
      "text": "caps written into emergency session rule",
      "start": 557.52,
      "duration": 4.28,
      "end": 561.8
    },
    {
      "text": "changes that will take years to formally",
      "start": 559.72,
      "duration": 5.44,
      "end": 565.16
    },
    {
      "text": "codify, you've moved $680 billion into",
      "start": 561.8,
      "duration": 6.24,
      "end": 568.04
    },
    {
      "text": "equity positions across 340 companies.",
      "start": 565.16,
      "duration": 5.4,
      "end": 570.56
    },
    {
      "text": "You own controlling stakes in 14 of the",
      "start": 568.04,
      "duration": 5.16,
      "end": 573.2
    },
    {
      "text": "30 largest corporations on Earth. The",
      "start": 570.56,
      "duration": 4.96,
      "end": 575.52
    },
    {
      "text": "combined market cap of your holdings at",
      "start": 573.2,
      "duration": 4.12,
      "end": 577.32
    },
    {
      "text": "the inflated prices your own buying",
      "start": 575.52,
      "duration": 5.52,
      "end": 581.04
    },
    {
      "text": "created is listed at over $1.1 trillion.",
      "start": 577.32,
      "duration": 5.24,
      "end": 582.56
    },
    {
      "text": "On paper, you are worth more than when",
      "start": 581.04,
      "duration": 3.84,
      "end": 584.88
    },
    {
      "text": "you started. The number is meaningless.",
      "start": 582.56,
      "duration": 4.04,
      "end": 586.6
    },
    {
      "text": "You can't sell without collapsing the",
      "start": 584.88,
      "duration": 4.2,
      "end": 589.08
    },
    {
      "text": "price you created. End of day seven,",
      "start": 586.6,
      "duration": 4.76,
      "end": 591.36
    },
    {
      "text": "$920 [music]",
      "start": 589.08,
      "duration": 5.28,
      "end": 594.36
    },
    {
      "text": "spent, $80 remaining. The markets are",
      "start": 591.36,
      "duration": 5.0,
      "end": 596.36
    },
    {
      "text": "closed. The interest never stopped.",
      "start": 594.36,
      "duration": 4.48,
      "end": 598.84
    },
    {
      "text": "Roughly $720 million",
      "start": 596.36,
      "duration": 4.68,
      "end": 601.04
    },
    {
      "text": "earned across the full seven days. You",
      "start": 598.84,
      "duration": 4.32,
      "end": 603.16
    },
    {
      "text": "ran out of open exchanges before you ran",
      "start": 601.04,
      "duration": 4.36,
      "end": 605.4
    },
    {
      "text": "out of money. You failed. Not because",
      "start": 603.16,
      "duration": 4.04,
      "end": 607.2
    },
    {
      "text": "you ran out of ideas, but because the",
      "start": 605.4,
      "duration": 3.6,
      "end": 609.0
    },
    {
      "text": "world ran out of things it could sell",
      "start": 607.2,
      "duration": 3.72,
      "end": 610.92
    },
    {
      "text": "you fast enough. Physical goods with",
      "start": 609.0,
      "duration": 3.92,
      "end": 612.92
    },
    {
      "text": "immediate title transfer capped out",
      "start": 610.92,
      "duration": 5.16,
      "end": 616.08
    },
    {
      "text": "somewhere around $100 to $110.",
      "start": 612.92,
      "duration": 5.08,
      "end": 618.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Everything above that either takes time",
      "start": 616.08,
      "duration": 3.8,
      "end": 619.88
    },
    {
      "text": "you didn't have, doesn't exist as",
      "start": 618.0,
      "duration": 3.88,
      "end": 621.88
    },
    {
      "text": "private property, or moves in price so",
      "start": 619.88,
      "duration": 3.96,
      "end": 623.84
    },
    {
      "text": "fast when you buy it that the purchase",
      "start": 621.88,
      "duration": 3.96,
      "end": 625.84
    },
    {
      "text": "undercuts itself. The richest people",
      "start": 623.84,
      "duration": 3.6,
      "end": 627.44
    },
    {
      "text": "alive don't spend their money because",
      "start": 625.84,
      "duration": 3.32,
      "end": 629.16
    },
    {
      "text": "the supply runs out long before the",
      "start": 627.44,
      "duration": 3.36,
      "end": 630.8
    },
    {
      "text": "money does. And the money that can't be",
      "start": 629.16,
      "duration": 3.84,
      "end": 633.0
    },
    {
      "text": "spent earns while you sleep. The earning",
      "start": 630.8,
      "duration": 5.8,
      "end": 636.6
    },
    {
      "text": "is faster than the spending.",
      "start": 633.0,
      "duration": 3.6,
      "end": 636.6
    }
  ]
}